      "title": "由此，奔赴深空·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "41317001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "登月航空器，二级发动机喷管内。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "好……和之前一样，只要穿过这边的分隔带，front应该就是发动机的外侧了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "啊，根据我们经过的路线来看，发动机的构造也大概可以弄明白了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "不愧是库特，真是让人安心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "嘿嘿……啊，到了，就是这里！把这个挡板推开的话，嘿咻！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "原来这就是航空器的发动机……居然这么庞大。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "这艘航空器的功能并没有普通的载人火箭那么复杂，如果是火箭的话，发动机还会更big的说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "是这样啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "这边都没有雕塑的身影，它们似乎没有在发动机停留，而是继续前往航空器的舱内了的说。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "唔，舱内啊……那里应该有原本的被抽选登月的手办，希望手办们没被那群雕塑影响。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "到了，前方应该就是航空器内部。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "唔，我还以为被抽选到的手办们会更加兴奋呢，但完全听不到声音啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "做好战斗准备。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我来开门。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317015",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317016",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "……啪嚓。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "怎么回事，这里的手办们都静静地站着……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "糟糕，他们的身上，是那些外星人雕塑表层的颜色！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "果然被控制了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41317020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "喂，它们过来了——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "呼……呼，太好了，大部分手办身上已经没有颜料了，等他们醒来的时候应该就能恢复神志了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "但变成流体的雕塑还是没有停止活动。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "怎么会这样……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "难道它们的目标还在前方吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "不好了，我们要快点追上去——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408006",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "再往前应该就是航空器的燃料区域了。燃料所使用的应该都是液态氢，非常dangerous的说……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408007",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "如果混入不明物质，有big boom的可能，那样的话，大家都会……！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……不行，它们已经深入燃料入口了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "呼……呼……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "这边的缝隙里，雕像还没完全进去！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408012",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "来不及细想，库特的双手伸向了那团流体——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408013",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "然后抓住了它。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……没有穿过去，抓到了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "但是库特并没有下一步的动作，而是唐突地维持着上一秒的动作。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "她的样子不对劲！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "难道是失去意识了吗……？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41408018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "距离航空器起飞只剩一分钟，来不及逃出了，先做好固定！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-1029",
