      ],
      "title": "由此，奔赴深空·Ⅳ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "41319001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "航空器已成功登陆月面——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "呼，到这边的岩石后面应该就不会被直播拍到了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……原来宇宙是这么广阔……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……好了，既然已经到达月球，接下来需要开始进行回到地球的准备，根据FULI公司的直播计划，我们——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "不要这么着急。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "现在比起回到地球，还有更激动人人心的目标不是吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "「Little Busters！月球漫步会！」，终于到达月球了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "哇呼——！这就是月球！感觉整个人都要颤抖得晕过去了——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "噢！虽然和所有少年漫画都不一样，但果然很厉害啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "……飞，飞起来了，而且没有任何支撑，或许这就是幽灵的日常呢，咯咯。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "嗯……那个月面行走的要点是……啊，果然实践起来不容易啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "要不要去月球的背面看看，充满了阴影与黑暗的地方，说不定……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "……外，外星人幽灵吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "实在是激动人心的计划，那么事不宜迟，现在就出发吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319016",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "当晨昏线逐渐远去——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "……虽说我经常去吓人，但今天还是有点被吓到了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "嗯……确实。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "完全是black呢，哇呼……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "居然是黑，黑色石碑。总感觉是不能深究的东西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "总之先回航空器吧，直播已经结束，留给我们的时间已经不多了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319022",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "众人逐步走向登月航空器的着陆处——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "以前恭介学长说的，「即使玩也不能半途而废，要认真才会觉得有趣」，我今天好像更明白了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "虽然一开始感觉「Little Busters！月球漫步会！」只是一个美好的期望，但是在努力的时候「月球漫步会」逐渐成了大家的目标。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "真是wonderful的目标呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "果然「Little Busters」最高，对吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "Yes的说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "呵呵，确实是这样的，能加入「Little Busters！月球漫步会！」真是太好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇萝",
          "text": "虽然每次都觉得这个名字很长就是了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "哈哈——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "快看航空器那边！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "是有着奇异色彩的流星……？啊！是外星人雕塑它们——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319033",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "闪闪发光的颜色从航空器的内部流淌而出，在空中重新变为水滴般的球体……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319034",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "但很快它们便如同流星般飞向更远处的深空，只留下无名色彩的尾迹——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "原来这就是雕塑真正的样子，它们的色彩在宇宙里似乎更加闪烁了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "那个梦……说不定宇宙深处是它们的家乡的说，它们的梦想会实现……嘿嘿，感觉好像有点期待呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "雕塑们也要fight哦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "库特？你刚刚说了什么吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "没什么了，说起来这个景象——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319040",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "这个也算流星雨，1秒都不能浪费，大家一起来许愿吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319041",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "当最后一缕奇异的色彩消失在黑暗的深空——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319042",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "呼，那么这次总算可以说了，「Little Busters！月球漫步会！」，MIssion complete！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319043",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……稍等，我觉得还有更大的任务。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319044",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "哇呼……？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319045",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "航空器的燃料……也被那些奇异的色彩一起带走了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319046",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "对了，我们现在该怎么回到地球？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319047",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "枣恭介",
          "text": "等等，等等，这不是大危机嘛——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "41319048",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "库特",
          "text": "哇呼——！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
